## Recommended work order (when choosing “what next”)

```
1) ATO copy figures wrong vs Xero-class / user asks tax basis?
   → 「ATO GST-ex 정렬」 (per-line GST-ex for all Annual income+expense; BAS/CTR parity)

2) Ops / roles when accounts exist?
   → Payroll-only smoke, then employee login

3) Only when user explicitly starts public product?
   → Track B (tenancy → auth **incl. employee role** → **mobile My Payroll** → onboarding → harden API)
     Detail: `.cursor/rules/accounting-track-b-employee-mobile-payroll.mdc`

4) Nice-to-have modules?
   → HR leave / WorkCover / audit IDB / AR-AP journals
```

